# 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY & ARCHITECTURE
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This application serves as the "Frontend Client" in a microservices architecture.
# It is strictly decoupled from the mathematical model (Phase 1), ensuring modularity.
#
# - PHASE 1 (BACKEND): The Logistic Regression model runs inside a separate 
#   R Plumber API service (Dockerized container). It handles the statistical logic.
#
# - PHASE 2 (FRONTEND): This Shiny App acts as the user interface. It contains 
#   NO model weights. Instead, it dynamically queries the API to "discover" 
#   the model structure and request predictions.
# ==============================================================================

